    "title": "Nocil South Asia Partners is Hiring: Quality Control Engineer (Senior)",
    "description": "We at Nocil South Asia Partners are looking for an experienced Quality Control Engineer based out of Pimpri-Chinchwad. If you are a result-oriented professional with a passion for excellence, we want to hear from you.\n\nAbout Nocil South Asia Partners:\nNocil South Asia Partners is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Oversee daily production operations to meet output targets\n• Manage raw material procurement and inventory levels\n• Manage supplier quality audits and vendor development\n• Train and supervise shop floor workers and supervisors\n• Monitor equipment performance and coordinate preventive maintenance\n• Ensure compliance with safety regulations and factory acts\n• Prepare production cost analysis and efficiency reports\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Ed / M.Ed from a recognized institution\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in AutoCAD\n• Proficiency in Six Sigma\n• Proficiency in GD&T\n• Proficiency in Quality Control\n• Proficiency in ERP Systems\n• Proficiency in 5S\n• Proficiency in Root Cause Analysis\n• Proficiency in Lean Manufacturing\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Pimpri-Chinchwad, Maharashtra, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Nocil South Asia Partners!",
